%% Telegram long polling e notifiche con riserva persistente.
sequenceDiagram
    actor Cliente
    participant Telegram as Telegram Bot API
    participant Bot as Python ChatEngine / Dispatcher
    participant API as ChatController
    participant Service as ChatService / MissionService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Cliente->>Telegram: sends plate / phone / location / problem
    Telegram-->>Bot: long-poll update
    Bot->>API: POST /chat/lookup-targa (Bearer)
    API->>Service: lookup and limiter
    Service->>DB: read customer, save grant
    API-->>Bot: VERIFICATA or DA_VERIFICARE
    Bot->>API: POST /chat/missioni (requestId, tipoProblema)
    API->>Service: create idempotent mission
    Service->>DB: persist mission (nuova or verifica_polizza) and chat recipient
    API-->>Bot: mission code and state
    Bot-->>Telegram: confirmation
    Service->>DB: transaction writes outbox on accepted/completed/cancelled
    Bot->>API: POST /chat/notifiche/claim
    API->>DB: PENDING to SENDING (skip locked)
    API-->>Bot: notification payloads
    Bot->>Telegram: send message
    Bot->>API: POST /chat/notifiche/{id}/esito
    API->>DB: SENT, or PENDING after 30 s, or FAILED after 5 attempts
    Telegram-->>Cliente: accepted / completed / cancelled update
